(card "exp:H-R1-1_rolling_30d_median_solo" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:H-R1-1_rolling_30d_median_solo"
  :body "---\nnav: 12\ntype: experiment\nid: H-R1-1\nshort_name: rolling_30d_median_solo\ntitle: \"H-R1-1 — size = clip(ratio/rolling_30d_median, 0.5, 1.5) on anchor base\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: h\nround: r1\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_h__sizing]]\"\ntrain_nav: 2.3919\ntrain_trade_count: 140\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8571\ntrain_sharpe: 6.9372\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0065\nval_nav_mean: 1.0667\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0812\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: 1.3232\ntest_trade_count: 20\ntest_sharpe: 6.9568\ntest_win_rate: 0.7500\ntest_max_drawdown: -0.0034\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: challenger\noutcome: test_pass\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [sizing]\npast_only_window_days: 30\nwarmup_required: 10\ncreated: 2026-05-17T02:00:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/h, round/r1, axis/sizing, status/challenger, outcome/test_pass, leak/clean, size/medium]\n---\n\n# H-R1-1 — anchor × clip(ratio/rolling_30d_median, 0.5, 1.5)\n\n> **TL;DR** —— H 系列 sizing 的 **第一代 prototype**：直接套在 anchor base 上（不换 trade selector），验证 sizing axis 自身是否能 add NAV。**train 2.39 / test 1.32 vs anchor 2.19/1.25**，分别 +9.3% / +6.0% —— 证明 sizing 在 anchor pool 上就有正贡献。后续 R2/R3b 换更强 base (C7.5 / C8.4) 才进一步放大 NAV。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 在不动 trade selector 的前提下，仅加 `ratio / 30d-past-median` 的 sizing factor，能否带来 NAV gain？\n- 假设：如果 ratio/median 反映信号强度，则 size weighted aggregate return 应严格高于 fixed-size。\n- 期待：train NAV +5-10%，test 上保留至少一半 edge。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：`/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_h/scripts/round_1_runner.py`\n- trade selector = anchor G2 (140 笔)\n- sizing：\n  $$ \\text{size}(t) = \\mathrm{clip}\\!\\left(\\frac{r_t}{\\widetilde{r}^{\\;\\text{past-30d}}_{\\,t}},\\; 0.5,\\; 1.5\\right) $$\n- mean_size = 1.058, std_size = 0.360.\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- `rolling_30d_ratio_median`: 对每个 trade 时刻 t 取 `events[event_time < t & event_time >= t-30d]` 的 ratio 中位数。\n- warmup<10 时 size=1.0（cold-start fallback）。\n- critic 2026-05-17 audit pass (`#leak/clean`)。\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 2.3919 | 140 | 6.94 | 85.7% | -0.65% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.0667 ± 0.081 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | 1.3232 | 20 | 6.96 | 75.0% | -0.34% |\n| **Δ test NAV vs anchor** | **+0.075** | 0 | -0.19 | 0 | +0.19pp |\n| **Δ train NAV vs anchor** | +0.204 | 0 | -0.76 | 0 | +0.36pp |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0。trade pool 不变 → 直接对比 anchor。\n- 注意：sharpe 略降（7.70 → 6.94）—— sizing variance 引入额外波动；但 mean return per trade 升 (0.56% → 0.63%) 抵消。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]] (直接套 anchor base)\n- **descendants**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R2-1__c75_linear_sizing]], [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R2-2__c84_linear_sizing]], [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R2-3__b_r8_1_sizing]], [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R2-4__c75_sqrt_damp]] (H-R2 换 base)\n- **descendants_via_R3b**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R3b-4__c84_kelly_lambda_1.5]] (SOTA)\n- **competes_with**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R1-2__pre_avg_amount_sizing]], [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R1-3__ratio_vol_blend]]\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_h/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (R1-1)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- **H 系列起点**：R1-1 是整个 sizing lineage 的母体。**任何未来 sizing 实验都应先在 anchor base 上跑同公式作 reference**，方便分离 \"sizing add\" vs \"trade-selector add\"。\n- 30d 窗口是 R1 直接选定，未在 H 系列 sweep —— vault gap，下次 arc 可补 7d/14d/60d 对比。\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_h__H-R1-1__rolling_30d_median_solo.md"
